1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,920
Hello and welcome to Ulearn English Language School in Dublin. My name is Neil. I'm going

2
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:11,920
to give you a quick run through for your student app. So let's dive right in. At the very start

3
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:16,740
there you can see your personal details, name and email address and so on. Moving on then

4
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:21,840
you can see your course, very important. You can give us feedback in there as well, hopefully

5
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:28,440
lots of 4s and 5s for your teacher, for the facilities, for the student success team and

6
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:34,240
an overall score for your course. Then we can see the attendance section, especially

7
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:39,639
important for non-EU students but if you are going to be absent please do give us a date

8
00:00:39,639 --> 00:00:44,360
and a reason if you can and then we will know that you're not going to be there. The accommodation,

9
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:49,040
very important on arrival that you know where you're going. If you click the address here

10
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:53,380
you'll be delivered to a Google map which usefully tells you exactly where you're going

11
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:57,840
to be living during your stay at Ulearn if you've booked one with us. And again you can

12
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:03,320
give feedback on arrival and you can give feedback at the end in your last week and

13
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:09,580
we encourage you to do so. Transport, please remember to give us your flight details so

14
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:15,919
that we can pick you up at the airport and drop you off again at the right time. Your

15
00:01:15,919 --> 00:01:21,199
documents again, crucially important for non-EU students. You can upload your own details

16
00:01:21,199 --> 00:01:26,480
there such as your passport and there we see Leo the Lion looking ready to learn and ready

17
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:33,720
to roar and from us as well you see the documents that we will issue to you for example. A letter

18
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:39,879
of acceptance there and that's crucially important for non-EU students. Moving on to the fun

19
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:44,360
stuff like socials. If you want to attend one of these socials it's pretty easy. All

20
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:49,180
you've got to do is click whichever one you're interested in attending and click the icon

21
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:53,480
and off you go. You can attend as many as you want, two or three per week happening.

22
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:59,019
If you enjoyed it, again give us a rating out of 10 so we know which ones are working.

23
00:01:59,019 --> 00:02:03,320
Finally then the support and FAQ section. You've got the email address for the success

24
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:08,779
team, our landline phone number and emergency and a comm phone number as well. If you wish

25
00:02:08,779 --> 00:02:14,360
you can message us directly from within the app and the FAQ section, there's plenty in

26
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:21,360
there if you wish to get some more information from us. Moving on then to the challengers.

27
00:02:21,399 --> 00:02:26,839
All challengers. If you joined the Kickstart challenge you did so with a reduction from

28
00:02:26,839 --> 00:02:33,440
our sales team in exchange for certain activities. In here you can see Leonardo the lion doing

29
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:38,919
very well. He's unlocked five out of six so far. He has given us his Instagram handle

30
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:44,600
and followed us on Instagram. He's attended 100% of his course. He attended a social event

31
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:50,600
and he was even kind enough to give us a review as well which unlocked his ambassador code.

32
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:56,440
That gives 10% to the referral, whoever comes, a friend or other person who wants to come

33
00:02:56,440 --> 00:03:03,360
to Ulearn and he also gets 10% of the course fee so everyone's a winner. The crucial component

34
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:08,919
here really is, and the one that causes some confusion and we want to explain it as quick

35
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:15,720
as we can, the progress posts. We're asking you to do three of them. They're video posts

36
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:21,960
and they can be really good fun to do as well. Normally we would give us one about your history.

37
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:27,080
Where did you come from? Why did you choose Dublin? Why did you choose Ulearn? A second

38
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:32,520
video perhaps about your initial impressions. Day one. Were you excited? Were you nervous?

39
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:39,000
And then finally a third video about lessons learned. What have you learned in class? What

40
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,320
would you advise another student coming from your country to do if you were to do it all over again?

41
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:50,839
Then you just have to literally paste in the social media link here so that we know that

42
00:03:50,839 --> 00:03:56,839
you have done it. If you don't post it then we don't know and it'll be verified by the

43
00:03:56,839 --> 00:04:02,360
success and social team and finally you're given a score and you can see a leaderboard here from

44
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:09,559
other challengers who have added their social media post. Finally the learning panel down here,

45
00:04:09,559 --> 00:04:14,919
number three, is where you do your placement test and that's kind of your first step on your

46
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:21,079
learning journey. You just start the test here, add in the answer and Leonardo will tell you if

47
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:28,119
you are right or if you are wrong. That'll be added to your oral test on day one and we'll be placing

48
00:04:28,119 --> 00:04:35,160
you after finalizing your test results. So thank you very much for your attention. I look forward

49
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:46,920
to welcoming you into the school and best of luck on your learning journey at Ulearn. Take care, bye!


